        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>First Impressions BLR150SMTSS4, Stainless Steel Blue Ridge Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Blue Ridge Stainless Steel Door Pull is a beautiful addition to modern spaces. It is made from stainless steel which means it is easy to care for. This modern door handle is available as a 18 inch, 24 inch, or 36 inch lengths. It can be surface mounted, thru-bolt mounted, or back-to-back mounted. This is a big, beautiful pull with some heft behind it--making it a great choice for high-traffic areas.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the First Impressions Blue Ridge Door Handle:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Stainless Steel</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/FII-BLR01-specifications.pdf?v=1704262334\"><b>First Impressions BLR150SMTSS4 Dimensions Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 3 Sizes:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<b>BLR150018SMTSS4:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 18\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center: 12\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Face Width: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Thickness: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 2-2/3\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Clearance: 1-4/5\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>BLR150024SMTSS4:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 24\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Mount: 18\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Face Width: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Thickness: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 2-2/3\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Clearance: 1-4/5\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>BLR150036SMTSS4:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 36\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Mount: 24\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Face Width: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Thickness: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 2-2/3\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Clearance: 1-4/5\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>",
