                "title": "Blue Ridge Stainless Steel Door Pull",
                "description": "The Blue Ridge Stainless Steel Door Pull is a beautiful addition to modern spaces. It is made from stainless steel which means it is easy to care for. This modern door handle is available as a 18 inch, 24 inch, or 36 inch lengths. It can be surface mounted, thru-bolt mounted, or back-to-back mounted. This is a big, beautiful pull with some heft behind it--making it a great choice for high-traffic areas.\r\n",
